        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Volleyball electronic scoresheet for the scorer's tablet"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "OpenVolley eScoresheet: the electronic volleyball scoresheet (FIVB and\nSwiss Volley rules) for the scorer's table. Set up a match, score\nrallies, substitutions, timeouts and sanctions, and produce the\nscoresheet PDF.\n\nWorks offline first: every match is stored on the tablet and scoring\nnever waits for the network. With internet it syncs to the OpenVolley\ncloud (backend.openvolley.app), so referee, bench and livescore screens\nfollow the match. At venues without internet, connect it to a local\nOpenVolley relay (desktop app, standalone server or venue box) by\nentering its LAN address, e.g. http://192.168.1.20:8080.\n\nBuilt for landscape tablets."
        },
